1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Qingjie''' - From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Qingjie''' (慶節) or '''Qing''' (慶) was a legendary leader of the '''Ji''' (姬) clan, which eventually established the Zhou dynasty in ancient China. He is sometimes credited as a duke of Zhou or with founding the city of Bin.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Traditional accounts list his father as Duke Liu and his son as Huangpu.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qingjie
