1 NAME Zhōng Lì /HUANG 黄中立 44A/
2 GIVN Zhōng Lì
2 _MARNM HUANG 黄中立 44A
1 NAME HUANG Zhong Li, 黄中立 44A
1 SEX M
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 44th generation. Approximately 1045 BC to _____. Son of Wang Suo (王所).
2 CONT
2 CONT Zhong Li (中立) was born during the time when Zhou Wu Wang (周武王), who established the Zhou Dynasty (周朝) in 1046 BC, was ill. He was given the name Zhong Li in the hope that he would not be drawn into any power struggle.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the reign of  Zhou Cheng Wang (周成王) of the early Western Zhou (西周初) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Qi Qu (起屈).
2 CONT
2 CONT 四十四世。约公元前1045 ---。王所之子, 起屈之父。周公东征时, 新建东都洛邑。
2 CONT
2 CONT 中立 (约公元前1045) 就出生在公元前1042年姬诵继承王位和后3年周公东征评定武庚和淮夷, 徐戎等的叛乱这个时后。可能元 (王) 所希望孩子不要卷入这场斗争, 将孩子取名为“中立”。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  黄正瑞的博客.
2 CONT
2 CONT
