1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 68th Generation Ancestor: 伍相 (Wǔ Xiāng)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 357 BC, he was the 禦史 (Yù Shǐ) of the 韓國 (Hán Guó). The record shows his tomb located at 千佛山 (Qiān Fúshān) facing towards the east, 安陸 (ān lù).
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, 蔡 (Ms. Cài) has four sons, they are 純秉 (Chún Bǐng), 純輝 (Chún Huī), 純耀 (Chún Huī), 純菁 (Chún Jīng). She was buried at 鵝公嶺 (é Gōng Lǐng) facing towards the south. 
