2 CONT * ''Han shu''. Beijing: Zhonghua shuju, 1983, vol. 12, 98.4013–37.
2 CONT * Loewe, Michael. “The Cosmological Context of Sovereignty in Han Times.” ''Bulletin of the School of Oriental and African Studies'' 65 (2002): 342–49.
