1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 69th generation. Approximately 425 BC to _____. 3rd and youngest son of Tuo (妥). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Minister in charge of the Treasury (钱府上士) during the Eastern Zhou (东周)/Warring States (战国) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Fu Shu Gong (父叔弓).
2 CONT
2 CONT 六十九世。约公元前425 ---。妥之子, 父叔弓之父。东周/战国时期为钱府上士, 掌官钱财的官职。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄正瑞的博客.
