2 CONT NG GWUN CHOONG 伍 君寵 (Generation 34), a joon see 進 士 (holder of the first degree in the civil service examination) of the Tong/Tang 唐 Dynasty, lived when Empress Mo/Wu 武 后 was ruling China (the end of the seventh century A.D.). He 
2 CONC did not serve as an official but remained in seclusion. He prepared a genealogy of the clan's earliest ancestors, from Ng Gee Sui to his own time. Dik Yun Git/Di Renjie 狄 仁 傑 did the calligraphy for the book cover, reading The Ng 
2 CONC Family Annals 《 伍 氏 家 ? 》 .
