1 CONT     * Mother
1 CONT           o Consort Zhao
1 CONT     * Wife
1 CONT           o Empress Shangguan, daughter of Shangguan An (b. 89 BC, d. 37 BC)
1 CONT     * Children
1 CONT           o None
1 CONT
